   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "<p>This figure shows involuntary muscle movement in part of the digestive system. What stimulates this involuntary response?</p> <p><img src=\"exercises/media/8ec5a14f559b91a1.jpg\" alt=\"“Illustration shows food moving down the esophagus, which is a muscular tube. Muscles constrict behind the food. The constriction moves down, pushing the food ahead of it, from the mouth to the stomach.\"> </p>",
   "answers": [
